
<div>
    <h3>How to Register Digital Bingo Cards</h3>
    <p>*Please Note*</p>
    <p>If applicable, have all players with paper cards lign-up before players with digital cards.</p>
</div>

<div>
    <p>A player comes forward.</p>
    <p>The host asks the player for their guess:<br>"Do you think the baby is a boy or a girl?"</p>
    <img src="/images/demo/step1.png" />
</div>

<div>
    <p>The host provides the player with an ID corresponding to the player's guess.</p>
    <p>Available IDs can be found below the card registration page.</p>
    <img src="/images/demo/step3.png" />
</div>

<div>
    <p>The player enters the ID on their device and accesses their bingo card.</p>
    <img src="/images/demo/step4.png" />
</div>

<div>
    <p>*Important*</p>
    <p>The host enters the same ID on the game player to complete the registration of the player's card.</p>
    <img src="/images/demo/step5.png" />
</div>
